      <div class="Section3"><a name="annex-reference-time-scales" id="annex-reference-time-scales"></a>
        <h1 class="Annex"><b>Annex C</b><br/>(normative)<br/><br/><b>Alphabetical list of reference time scale names in English and their code elements</b></h1>
        <p class="TableTitle" style="text-align:center;">Table C.1</p>
        <div align="center">
